    <statement><p>Calculate <m>\mathbf{r}'(t)</m> and <m>\mathbf{T}(t)</m>, where
<me>\mathbf{r}(t)=\langle 2t-3, -\left(1+2t\right), 4+t\rangle.</me></p>
<p><m>\mathbf{r}'(t) = \langle</m> <fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0001"/><m>,</m> <fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0002"/><m>,</m> <fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0003"/><m>\rangle</m>.</p>
<p><m>\mathbf{T}(t) = \langle</m> <fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0004"/><m>,</m> <fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0005"/><m>,</m> <fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0006"/><m>\rangle</m>.</p>
</statement>
